# Local development only — none of this belongs in a plugin folder on somebody's disk.
*.log
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# oh-my-openagent leaves this behind wherever it runs, this repo included
.omo/
# A symlink into the codegraph index. The marketplace validator refuses a symlink
# anywhere in a plugin folder.
.codegraph
# Exported agent-session transcripts, dropped in the repo root by hand.
session-*.md
# Scratch file used to tell a full /tmp apart from a full home directory.
.diskprobe

# The working notes behind this plugin — the research brief, the decisions as they were
# taken, and the questions still open. They are kept on disk because they are worth having,
# and out of the repository because `omarchy plugin add` clones the whole tree onto somebody
# else's machine, and none of it is theirs to read.
docs/DESIGN.md
docs/DECISIONS.md
docs/OPEN-QUESTIONS.md
